      "content": "it's hard to explain to someone who isn't... well, who isn't me. it's not even that i'm \"sad\" exactly. it's more like i'm just tired of the cycle. the doctors, the pills, the same four walls. i feel like a burden to everyone, even just by being around. sometimes i think the world would just be a little bit lighter, a little bit quieter, if i wasn't still clinging to things. does that even make sense? or am i just being dramatic?",
